  "goodToKnow": "Die Verzinsung is the interest paid on money or the rate of return: eine attraktive Verzinsung, die Verzinsung von Anleihen. Der Zins (usually plural Zinsen) is interest, and der Zinseszins compound interest. From 2014 to 2022, the ECB's negative rates meant Germans' savings earned almost nothing, and some banks charged Verwahrentgelt (custody fees). Plural: die Verzinsungen."
